WEBVTT

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.763
and who had a champion?

00:07:00.797 --> 00:07:03.230
Every child deserves a champion,

00:07:03.263 --> 00:07:05.430
an adult who will never give up on them,

00:07:05.463 --> 00:07:08.430
who understands the power of connection,

00:07:08.463 --> 00:07:12.063
and insists that they become
the best that they can possibly be.

00:07:12.363 --> 00:07:14.597
Is this job tough? You betcha.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.830
Oh God, you betcha.

00:07:16.863 --> 00:07:20.063
But it is not impossible.

00:07:20.097 --> 00:07:21.830
We can do this. We're educators.

00:07:21.863 --> 00:07:24.097
We're born to make a difference.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.497
Thank you so much.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:30.830
(Applause)